<main>
    <section class="hero" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem 2rem;">
        <h1>Simple Pricing That Scales With Your Team</h1>
        <p class="subhead" style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:1.1rem;">AI-powered scheduling software that pays for itself in saved hours. No hidden fees, no annual contracts, cancel anytime.</p>
