                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ AI-powered shift matching</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Drag-and-drop scheduling calendar</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Mobile app for iOS and Android</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Shift reminders via SMS and email</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Smart conflict detection and alerts</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Labor law compliance monitoring</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Shift swap and time-off requests</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Role-based scheduling templates</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Advanced analytics dashboard</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Multi-location management</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Integrations (Slack, Teams, QuickBooks, ADP)</li>
                <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;color:var(--text);">✓ Email + priority support</li>
            </ul>
            <button class="btn-pricing btn-pricing--primary js-checkout"
                    data-plan-label="Senzii — $5/staff member/mo">Start Your Free Trial</button>
            <p style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:1rem;">No credit card required · Cancel anytime · No setup fees</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem 1rem 3rem;text-align:center;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Cost Calculator</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem;">See what your team would pay. Pricing is simple: $5 × number of staff you schedule.</p>
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.95rem;">
            <thead>
                <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);">
                    <th style="text-align:left;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">Team Size</th>
                    <th style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">Monthly Cost</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">5 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$25/mo</td></tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">10 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$50/mo</td></tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">15 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$75/mo</td></tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">25 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$125/mo</td></tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">50 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$250/mo</td></tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);"><td style="padding:0.75rem;">100 staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">$500/mo</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:0.75rem;">500+ staff</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:0.75rem;color:var(--text);">Contact us</td></tr>
